# Workspace Gemini Entry

Project-local lite workflow entrypoints:

- Stage advance: `pwsh -File .assistant\entry\advance-stage.ps1 -TaskId <task-id> -Tool <claudecode|codex|gemini>`
- Artifact validation: `pwsh -File .assistant\entry\validate-lite-artifacts.ps1 -TaskId <task-id>`

These shims delegate to the managed harness repo scripts and always use the installed shared vault:

- Repo root: `{REPO_ROOT}`
- Vault root: `{VAULT_PATH}`

Only `TEST -> DONE` can omit `-Tool`.
